        {
          "title": "*",
          "content": "<p><em>活人售货机</em>*</p>\n<p>我在上海地铁上看见一个男子，透明挎包上贴着两行字。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202208/bg2022082407.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>我忍不住好奇，拿出手机长焦，终于看清了：“可售商品，价格面议”。这难道是活人售货机？</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202208/bg2022082408.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [],
