        {
          "title": "雪泥",
          "content": "<p>积雪落到零度但还未结冰的河道里面，会形成一种雪和水的混合物，称为雪泥（snezhura）。</p>\n<p>这种景象非常罕见，下面就是在圣彼得堡拍到的雪泥照片。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/220204/bg2022040610.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/220204/bg2022040611.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
